@startuml UserAccountState
title User account state diagram
state "Pending Activation" as PendingActivation
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 90
hide empty description

PendingActivation : invalid or expired OTP / new OTP requested (FR-01)
PendingActivation : register again / new OTP and new password (FR-01)

[*] --> PendingActivation : register [ID in IUB Records,\ncontact on record] (FR-01)
PendingActivation -down-> Active : correct OTP within 5 minutes (FR-01)
Active --> Active : password reset with OTP (FR-04)
Active -down-> Locked : 5 wrong passwords\nin a row (FR-02)
Locked --> Locked : login attempt or password\nreset rejected (FR-02, FR-04)
Locked -up-> Active : 15 minutes pass (FR-02)

note left of Locked
  Log in and log out change the session,
  not the account state.
end note
@enduml